# Judge10-15-1

@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@pauseTrial false

@hideStageScreen 1

@char AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Option_Arms-,ArmR-Option-Off
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate たしかにここは<br>ロクでもない場所にも見える。

@char AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "だが……<br>だからといって<br>本当に<link=\"Objection_02_05_15_01\">帰る</link>必要は<br>あるのか……？"

@char AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "魔法を使えるからと言って<br>奇異の目で見られることもなく、<br>わずらわしい<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_02\">人間関係</link>もない……。"

@char AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL1,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "……案外、<br>ここで暮らす方が<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_03\">楽</link>かもしれない。"

@char AnAn.Default,ArmR1,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Angry_Closed01
@gosubModifyCamera 0
@printDebate "だからわがはいは<br>べつにここから出ることを<br><link=\"Objection_02_05_15_04\">望んではいない</link>。"

@char AnAn.Default,ArmR5,ArmL5,Angle01/Head/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Uncomfortable_Open02,Angle01/Head/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Uncomfortable_Open
@gosubModifyCamera 0
