# ==============================================================================
# ◎回想シーン（流用）●シーン2‐0‐4
# ==============================================================================

@bgm Bgm_45_2 { Volume:0.2 }
@Wait 0.2
@ResetText 
@back SolidColor.Custom { time:0 }
@back SolidColor.Custom { time:0.4 }
@Wait 0.4
@back 1_1 { Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} time:0 }
@char Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open { time:0 }
@printer Normal.Stream
@back SolidColor.Custom { time:0.4 }
@Wait 0.4

@print あてぃしを配信に映すことで、<br>あっちのあてぃしとアンテナが繋がったの。 { author:Coco speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@print つっても、魔女化が進んだあてぃししか<br>使えねー能力みたいだから。 { author:Coco speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@char Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Closed,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@print 今のあてぃしはあっちのあてぃしから<br>限定的な情報を得るくらいしかできんけど。 { author:Coco speed:1 waitInput:true Wait:true }

@ResetText 
@back SolidColor.Custom { time:0.4 }
@Wait 0.4
@hide MainBackground-Flashback,Coco-Flashback { time:0 }
@printer Normal.Simple
@back SolidColor.Custom { time:0.4 }
@Wait 0.4
@bgm Bgm_45_2
